1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,994
I built CEO Newsroom for one simple reason:

2
00:00:04,114 --> 00:00:07,163
to make tech news easier to understand.

3
00:00:07,463 --> 00:00:10,177
Pick an article and ask a question.

4
00:00:10,297 --> 00:00:13,301
Our AI presenters explain what happened,

5
00:00:13,421 --> 00:00:17,379
how it works, and its possible impact, with sources.

6
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:20,373
When several companies are involved,

7
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:23,152
compare their different perspectives.

8
00:00:23,452 --> 00:00:26,156
Explore official company videos,

9
00:00:26,276 --> 00:00:30,260
ask follow-up questions, and keep the conversation going.

10
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,159
Tap the heart to save an article.

11
00:00:33,279 --> 00:00:37,053
Your saved chats make it easy to pick up where you left off.

12
00:00:37,353 --> 00:00:39,737
Welcome to CEO Newsroom.

13
00:00:39,857 --> 00:00:43,561
Stay curious. Stay in good company.
